  "userDescription": "Table machinesraw_normalized represents telemetry sent by machines:\r\n- machine_id: id of the single, specific machine\r\n- attribute_name: name of the measure sent by the machine\r\n- attrbiute_value_decimal: real number representing the value retrieved for that measure\r\n- machine_type: type of the machine\r\n- state: machine state, can be running, stop, anomaly\r\n- timestamp: timestamp the measure has been sent\r\n\r\nTable machinesparameters describe when a machine is considered in a normal state, by attribute.\r\n\r\nIf asked by user to understand any possible anomaly, check if values by telemetry are in range (by machine and attribute), if not there is an anomaly. If not specified, use always last 5 minutes of telemetry data",
